{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261026/photo/bkn-20261026181638439-1026_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261026181638\"/><p>報案人被送往北區醫院治理。</p><p>今晨(26日)11時44分，執法部門收到一名姓吳(42歲)男子報案，指他在粉嶺坪輋河壩村一村屋外，與另一名姓李(47歲)男子因嘈音問題起爭執。期間，有人用一把鐮刀破壞其單車，並且擊中他的手部及手機。</p><p>人員接報到場，經初步調查後，確認報案人的財物並無受損，遂以涉嫌「傷人」拘捕李男，他現正被扣留調查。吳男經初步敷治後，清醒被送往北區醫院治理。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-26T10:40:53.460079+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":192,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-26T10:16:38+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-26T11:38:08.817403+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-26T10:38:10.429599+00:00","content_hash":"1a81fb2b6b181bcfe2c403710f469d9eb962fa26b4b5e6ad58cd80f9f4d36356","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-26T10:40:53.460079+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}